{"product_id":"the-richard-laymon-collection-flesh-and-resurrection-dreams-v-5","title":"The Richard Laymon Collection: \"Flesh\" AND \"Resurrection Dreams\" v. 5","description":"\u003cp\u003eFLESH No one in town has ever seen anything like it before: a slimy, mobile tube of glistening yellow flesh with dull, staring eyes and an obscene, probing mouth. But the real horror is not what it looks like, or even what it does to you when it invades your flesh - but what it makes you do to others... RESURRECTION DREAMS Melvin was definitely the biggest creep in Ellsworth High, and the other kids mercilessly taunted him fro his odd looks and weird behaviour. Vicki was the only one to stand up for him but even she had to admit he'd gone too far when he dug up a body and attempted to bring it back to life with the aid of a car battery. Years later Vicki still has nightmares about Melvin's 'joke' and now that she's back in Ellsworth she knows she'll have to see him again. Recently released from a mental institution, Melvin is acting stranger than ever. His experiments with the dead have progressed and as soon as he can get Vicki - or rather her body - where he wants her, he can realise his most chilling dream of all...\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Richard Laymon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780755331727\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 640\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594338111641,"sku":"9RE9780755331727","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-richard-laymon-collection-flesh-and-resurrection-dreams-v-5-720545.jpg?v=1694792693","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-richard-laymon-collection-flesh-and-resurrection-dreams-v-5","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}